<title>USA: CardioVascular Dynamics wins European okay.</title>
<headline>CardioVascular Dynamics wins European okay.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CardioVascular Dynamics Inc said on Wednesday its quality system meets requirements of the European Economic Community's medical device directive, giving the company the ability to ship its products to all European countries that adhere to the same standards.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to launch over 50 new product models over the next 12-18 months in international markets,&quot; Michael Henson, chief executive officer, said in a statement. &quot;This certification is an essential ingredient of these product launch plans and to the continued expansion of our business in international markets.&quot;</p>
</text>
